<title>POLAND: ECHO TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 75.</title>
<headline>ECHO TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 75.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 32,000 shares in Echo Investment SA at 75 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Echo traded at 78 zlotys in 6,767 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
